{"pageProps":{"platform":"swift","meta":{"title":"DataStore","description":"クラウドへのシームレスな同期と永続化、およびデバイス間でのオンライン・オフラインデータの同期","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore"},"childPageNodes":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/set-up-datastore/index.mdx","title":"Amplify DataStore をセットアップ","description":"Amplify DataStore は、オフラインおよびオンラインシナリオのための追加コードを記述することなく、共有および分散データを活用するためのプログラミングモデルを提供します。これにより、分散されたクロスユーザーデータの操作がローカルのみのデータの操作と同じくらい簡単になります。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/set-up-datastore"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/manipulate-data/index.mdx","title":"データの操作","description":"DataStore でデータを保存、クエリ、ページング、更新、削除、監視する方法を学習します。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/manipulate-data"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/relational-models/index.mdx","title":"リレーショナルモデル","description":"DataStoreが'has one'、'has many'、'belongs to'などのモデル間の関係をどのように処理するかについて詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/relational-models"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/sync-to-cloud/index.mdx","title":"クラウドへのデータ同期","description":"DataStoreがAppSyncバックエンドに接続し、GraphQLを使用してローカルに保存されたすべてのデータを自動的に同期する方法について詳しく説明します。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","