ter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/additional-methods"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/schema-updates/index.mdx","title":"スキーマの更新","description":"DataStore のスキーマ更新を実行する方法を詳しく学ぶ","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/schema-updates"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/how-it-works/index.mdx","title":"仕組み","description":"Amplify DataStoreは、オンラインでもオフラインでもデータの書き込み、読み込み、変更を監視できる永続的なオンデバイスストレージリポジトリを提供し、クラウドおよびデバイス間でのシームレスな同期を実現します。仕組みの詳細を学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/how-it-works"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/example-application/index.mdx","title":"サンプルアプリケーション","description":"Amplify DataStoreを使用した完全な例とリソース。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/example-application"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/customize-primary-keys/index.mdx","title":"プライマリキーのカスタマイズ","description":"Amplify DataStoreカテゴリの高度なワークフロー（カスタムプライマリキーを含む）についてさらに詳しく学びます。","platforms":["javascript","react-native","flutter","swift","android","angular","nextjs","react","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/customize-primary-keys"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/build-a-backend/more-features/datastore/data-usage-policy/index.mdx","title":"データ